      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An update on this would be great but it shouldn’t be limited to only worlds. If this can’t be done because of security issues that's understandable, tell us instead of letting us wonder for a year whats happening. I have an alternative proposal, though, white-list script components from popular Unity assets packs such and KriptoFX. If you can allow dynamic bones, i don't see how that is different.",
